    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener>
                    <dateline><date when="1947-03-23">March 23, 1947</date></dateline><salute>Dear
                            <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Prof.
                        Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>When I was at your home with <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1040" type="person"
                        >Prof. Kempner</rs> in November of last year, we discussed the present state
                    of German universities. I told you at the time that I had a manuscript <q>deep
                        down in my files somewhere</q>, dealing with the University at <rs
                        ref="#tillich_place_id__136" type="place">Erlangen</rs>.</p>
                <p>Unfortunately, these manuscripts arrived only a short time ago, and I have
                    translated them for further use.<note type="ea">Dem Brief ist die genannte
                        Übersetzung des Berichts über die Universität <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__136" type="place">Erlangen</rs>
                        beigelegt.</note></p>
                <p>The story broke last July even in the papers of this country, but not in such
                    great detail.</p>
                <p>Are you still planning to teach in <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__122" type="place"
                        >Germany</rs>? As you know, <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1040" type="person"
                        >Prof. Kempner</rs> went back a short while ago, to take over the
                    Ministerial Case in the forthcoming trials at <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__327"
                        type="place">Nuremberg</rs>. I personally haven&apos;t made up my mind yet
                    of whether I should return to <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__736" type="place"
                        >Europe</rs> or stay here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <salute>With many thanks for your hospitality, and best regards to you and <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person">Mrs. Tillich</rs>,<lb/>I
                        remain,<lb/>Sincerely yours,</salute>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rend="hand"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__4953" type="person">Edith
                                Simon</rs></hi></signed>
                </closer>

            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
